# Chainsaw's "whenever one or more creatures die" is a leaves-the-battlefield ability: it looks back to the board as it was
# before the event (CR 603.10a), so creatures dying at the same time as Hushbringer, Hushbringer included, don't cause it to
# trigger (Hushbringer's rulings). Bot1 casts Ornithopter, Chainsaw (no target) and Hushbringer on turn 1; on turn 3
# Pyroclasm kills Hushbringer and the Ornithopter together, and Chainsaw gets no rev counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Chainsaw
Hushbringer
Ornithopter
Pyroclasm
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

